"2008 to 2026, this book showcases the most innovative and eye-catching "
"packaging design from around the world. Covering food, beverage, beauty, and "
"luxury goods packaging, it highlights how creative design can transform "
"ordinary products into memorable branded experiences."
msgstr ""
